  ('hanzi_ge', '个', '個', 'general measure word', 'kata bantu hitung umum', array['general measure word']::text[], array['kata bantu hitung umum']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'ge', 'ge0', '[{"hanzi":"个","text":"ge","tone":0}]'::jsonb, 0, '0', 'The universal counter — stick it after any number and it counts *any thing*. ge is light and neutral. Tone 0 just rides along.', 'Penghitung universal — tempel setelah angka apapun untuk menghitung *benda apapun*. ge ringan dan netral. Nada 0 numpang lewat.', null, null, null, array['[object Object]', '[object Object]']::text[], 1, array['measure_word', 'beginner', 'high_frequency']::text[], true),
  ('hanzi_bei', '杯', '杯', 'cup', 'gelas', array['cup']::text[], array['gelas']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'bēi', 'bei1', '[{"hanzi":"杯","text":"bēi","tone":1}]'::jsonb, 1, '1', 'A wooden base holding liquid — shaped like a *cup*. bēi ≈ "bay" flat. Tone 1 high and steady, like a full cup sitting still.', 'Wadah kayu yang menampung cairan — bentuknya kayak *cangkir*. bēi ≈ "bei" flat. Nada 1 tinggi rata, kayak cangkir penuh yang diam.', null, null, null, array['[object Object]', '[object Object]']::text[], 2, array['measure_word', 'noun', 'beginner']::text[], true),
